WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:13,020
Have you seen the moon? Slow down.

2
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,820
My hair hasn’t been dried yet

3
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,020
The cold is not gone yet

4
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:18,620
I didn’t wipe my hair properly and didn’t cover myself with a quilt.

5
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:31,810
My voice has become hoarse in movie theaters

6
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:37,490
Really awesome Sister Wang

7
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:38,490
Go and get busy

8
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:40,090
I help her blow dry her hair

9
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:46,020
That's right

10
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,220
It's Kong Jie

11
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:48,820
I still have a surprise

12
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,780
Now you can turn the frame into a piece

13
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:52,180
Even finer ones won’t work.
